#: challenges/views.py:2327
msgid "This challenge's ownership can no longer be transferred."
msgstr "La propiedad de este reto ya no se puede transferir."

#: challenges/views.py:2352
msgid "Ownership can only be transferred to an active, accepted participant."
msgstr ""
"La propiedad solo se puede transferir a un participante activo y aceptado."

#: challenges/views.py:2377
#, python-format
msgid "Ownership transferred to %(name)s."
msgstr "Propiedad transferida a %(name)s."

#: challenges/views.py:2384 challenges/views.py:2395
msgid "Transfer Ownership"
msgstr "Transferir Propiedad"

#: challenges/views.py:2385
msgid "transfer ownership of"
msgstr "transferir la propiedad de"

#: challenges/views.py:2386
#, python-format
msgid " to %(name)s"
msgstr " a %(name)s"

#: challenges/views.py:2388
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(name)s will gain full control of this challenge — closing, cancelling, "
"inviting, and removing participants. You will remain a regular participant. "
"Only the new owner can transfer ownership back to you, so this cannot be "
"undone on your own."
msgstr ""
"%(name)s obtendrá el control total de este reto — cerrar, cancelar, invitar "
"y eliminar participantes. Tú seguirás siendo un participante normal. Solo el "
"nuevo propietario puede transferirte la propiedad de vuelta, por lo que no "
"puedes deshacer esto por tu cuenta."

#: challenges/views.py:2413
msgid "This challenge can no longer be cancelled."
msgstr "Este reto ya no se puede cancelar."

#: challenges/views.py:2423
msgid "Challenge cancelled."
msgstr "Reto cancelado."

#: challenges/views.py:2429 challenges/views.py:2438
#: templates/challenges/settings.html:45
msgid "Cancel Challenge"
msgstr "Cancelar Reto"

#: challenges/views.py:2430
msgid "cancel"
msgstr "cancelar"

#: challenges/views.py:2432
msgid ""
"Cancelling voids the challenge entirely — no final sync runs, no scores are "
"recorded, and no closing notifications are sent. The challenge is removed "
"from the Find Challenges list. This action cannot be undone."
msgstr ""
"Cancelar anula el reto por completo — no se ejecuta ninguna sincronización "
"final, no se registra ninguna puntuación y no se envían notificaciones de "
"cierre. El reto se elimina de la lista de Buscar Retos. Esta acción no se "
"puede deshacer."

